%% Per-device circuit breaker — companion to PDF Figure 4 (state machine)

stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> CLOSED

    CLOSED: CLOSED<br/>use NPU
    OPEN: OPEN<br/>CPU fallback only
    HALF_OPEN: HALF-OPEN<br/>run probe-graph

    CLOSED --> OPEN: fatal error<br/>(ERROR_DEVICE_REMOVED)
    OPEN --> HALF_OPEN: 30s timer<br/>(doubles each cycle, cap 30min)
    HALF_OPEN --> CLOSED: probe passes ×3
    HALF_OPEN --> OPEN: probe fails

    note right of HALF_OPEN
        Probe details:
        - 8-token prefill on dedicated probe-graph
        - 60 ms budget
        - must return correct fixed-output tensor
        - guards against zombie driver
    end note
